<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /H3
/P 305 0 R
/T ( BUSUU IS AN INTERACTIVE LANGUAGE-LEARNING PLATFORM DESIGNED TO HELP USERS MASTER NEW LANGUAGES THROUGH STRUCTURED COURSES, REAL-WORLD PRACTICE, AND FEEDBACK FROM NATIVE SPEAKERS. THE PLATFORM COMBINES LESSONS TAILORED TO INTERNATIONAL STANDARDS \(CEFR\) WITH COMMUNITY-DRIVEN LEARNING TO ENHANCE GRAMMAR, VOCABULARY, AND PRACTICAL CONVERSATION SKILLS.)
